HST Office: Sort moves toward Excel's level list (owner-approved Microsoft Office parity for beta.5).

The header option comes first, one row per sort level, and Add Level / Delete Level buttons (Delete removes
the last level). Levels still appear on their own when the last one gets a column. Options stay on their tab.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/runtime/check-dialogs-sheets.py (sort).
